#[ Supported ]

##[ Heading ]

```tm
# heading

#[ heading ]
#[ heading ]{}
```

##[ Outline ]

```tm
- outline
- [x] checked
1. sorted

- outline
- outline :{}
- (x) checked
- (x) checked :{}
-. sorted
```

##[ Link ]

```tm
[display](path)
[[wikilink]]

@[display](path:path)
@(wiki:file_name)
```

##[ Embed ]

```tm
![embed](path)
![[embed]]

<embed>[embed](path:path)
<embed>(wiki:file_name)
```

##[ Blockquote ]

```tm
> blockquote

<blockquote>[ blockquote ]
```

```tm
\`\`\`tm
\`\`\`

<codeblock>(tm)[
]
\`\`\`(tm)
\`\`\`
\`\`\`tm
\`\`\`
```

```tm
**strong**
*siranai*
==marker==
_torikesi_
`nanikore?`
```

```tm
---

----
-----
---[ display ]---
----[💫]----
